OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with a frost developing in
OL,7,Fplaces through the evening. Cloud
OL,8,Fbuilds in with persistent, locally
OL,9,Fheavy, rain developing and reaching
OL,10,Fall parts by morning. Sleet and snow
OL,11,Flikely over high ground. Becoming
OL,12,Fbreezy and feeling cold.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FA cloudy, cold and wet day
OL,15,Fwith persistent rain and some strong
OL,16,Fwinds. Sleet or snow continuing to
OL,17,Ffall across the hills until late
OL,18,Fmorning with some accumulations
OL,19,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
